@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #2d3142
skinparam ArrowColor #4f5d75
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #ececec
skinparam NoteBorderColor #bfc0c0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam activityBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam stateBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam classBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam classBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam circleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam circleBorderColor #2d3142
title State — PredictionStatus trong DiagnosePage
hide empty description
[*] --> idle : mount / status initial
state idle
state uploading
state analyzing
state success #FBECE5
state error
idle --> uploading : analyze [selectedFile && !busy]
error --> uploading : analyze [selectedFile && !busy] / retry
success --> uploading : analyze [selectedFile && !busy]
uploading --> analyzing : onUploadComplete [!aborted]
uploading --> success : promise resolved [!aborted]
analyzing --> success : promise resolved [!aborted]
uploading --> error : catch [!aborted]
analyzing --> error : catch [!aborted]
idle --> error : selectFile / MIME,size,decode invalid
error --> error : selectFile invalid
success --> error : selectFile invalid (via clearImage)
idle --> idle : clearImage / reset
uploading --> idle : clearImage / abort + reset
analyzing --> idle : clearImage / abort + reset
success --> idle : clearImage / reset
error --> idle : clearImage / reset
note bottom of idle
Ảnh chọn hợp lệ vẫn idle.
isPreparing là state riêng, không phải PredictionStatus.
Abort khi unmount không tạo error; component bị hủy.
end note
note bottom of success
Không phải lifecycle lưu DB.
Prediction entity không có Status / Failed / Processing.
end note
@enduml
